                                "sense_id": "65d7bea7-5a03-31ff-8c67-3c75edc0dcd7",
                                "text": "A young fool, bent on sportful pursuits instead of serious; more and more shuddering at Law. To the surprise and indignation of M. Arouet Senior."
                            }
